@startuml
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Iniciar Sesión (CLI HTTP)

actor "Administrador" as Admin
participant "CLI (Click)" as CLI
participant "APIClient" as Client
participant "API (FastAPI)" as API
participant "AuthService" as Auth
participant "UsuarioRepository" as Repo
database "Base de Datos" as DB

Admin -> CLI: Ejecuta 'sighor login'
activate CLI
CLI -> Admin: Solicita username (prompt)
Admin -> CLI: Ingresa username
CLI -> Admin: Solicita password (prompt)
Admin -> CLI: Ingresa password
CLI -> Client: post('/token', {username, password})
activate Client
Client -> API: POST /token (username, password)
activate API
API -> Auth: authenticate_user(username, password)
activate Auth
Auth -> Repo: get_by_username(username)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM usuarios WHERE username = ?
activate DB
DB --> Repo: Usuario (hash)
deactivate DB
Repo --> Auth: Usuario
deactivate Repo
Auth -> Auth: verify_password(password, hash)
alt Credenciales Válidas
    Auth -> Auth: create_access_token(data)
    Auth --> API: Token JWT
    API --> Client: 200 OK (access_token)
    deactivate API
    Client --> CLI: Response(200, token)
    deactivate Client
    CLI -> CLI: token_manager.save_token(token)
    CLI --> Admin: Sesión iniciada exitosamente
else Credenciales Inválidas
    Auth --> API: False / Exception
    deactivate Auth
    API --> Client: 401 Unauthorized
    deactivate API
    Client --> CLI: Response(401)
    deactivate Client
    CLI --> Admin: Credenciales inválidas
end
deactivate CLI

note right of API
  **Backend FastAPI reutilizado:**
  - AuthService
  - UsuarioRepository
  - Base de datos SQLite
  Sin modificaciones
end note

@enduml
